   "source": [
    "## 1  Load & Reframe Online Retail II as Field-Service Bookings\n",
    "\n",
    "| Online Retail II concept | FieldServe concept |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| `Invoice` | `booking_id` |\n",
    "| `Customer ID` | `customer_id` |\n",
    "| `InvoiceDate` | `booking_date` |\n",
    "| `Quantity × Price` (summed per invoice) | `invoice_amount` |\n",
    "| `Invoice` starting with 'C' | cancelled booking |\n",
    "\n",
    "Handles both the two-sheet Excel distribution and the two-CSV distribution automatically."
   ]
  },
